;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/36OwAGsbJxvliFBVziUlbz--OtYnOAgWI1oMMjt9dhz3fjGMM1Wy4i2fhpJKxuZ66UVG5vH3YGBMx_qgSWj2-5p8mgtejZqSOzXfSRwhB36HS2XqyT4Fpag6YeTTkd8cLnK1wNgxfZIK_HahG7MsaM0OWaEDsRWd_z4S3p1dXhaLZ32NYLAY5dYj4Rr29AfkMiCRCOryDcgqWTue9b-9JuPwGb90juCtXESjvvwzcY_HDrHDfgpNAXH5xJw28FX8WhjL2rw0GVxtTcAw_gMFSL2V7cEoDK-UmBF7HGt9AIWkhjm5d9JXurTRX5lZtLlXG6kPm0kLQ85XoNmUPlgdLdNjsrwBKmpkIHlCqzHMc3iFAWGOWLnojFqhdl4s5a_nAtLbN9YKt-RS2FGV7Bq__FJ4ZVy4B4M7L50SuoMcED9NX_s0YlWksJPg__jszUA2pAbM9Mj3SrHnLSr2M4NAgMoqeO0PevE4Di521auGutGQNJLv3OAg2dOQhV1XYFjRdbk02CVyalhZeFyGUshDmpiZxPAf5hbmSt8FP-XO6EI/xU1wDaYkPCk9v7XKwPNmRVN8V3a1s5Hb/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="瑞典选民在有史以来最接近的选举中陷入困境数日"&gt;这里一片混乱&lt;/a&gt;，就像其他地方一样。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;当全球政治、经济，甚至人类的未来（如果人工智能巨头可信的话）都受到攻击时，瑞典似乎是一个富裕且可预测的避风港。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;但昨天的选举旨在解决一个大问题，即曾经无处不在的社会民主党形式的中左翼能否为欧洲志同道合的政党甚至美国的民主党提供一种新的模式来&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/7wmAAiJ0piDMS_qoFsLi5nrx6FmuISoMsZiDmIu-4P4BIJn5EfOPPXAEwbAy7LQjwsAUNWKITauRNbXdsxnIRvEWAHVU_SFrNCDKcKZomx0KOB1nXOdlxVVl9b24mBA2eQlp5dyAhIr1Y8EHWOY728rELPZkZH3dNqBYUXPZBsLjzFTQH62EZ6_8fYE5W_0EtiroiyFgss9G8EglVmYjFBLCMb067C0n6UNpheQGswkEimpOTSGEcoYfkZsU53Lhzs-ZnMrPzBWu1OJgnWRD1QHsPSQcHa-qClbxrEHoXkUSRhwxsuNXHDox6B87DDvz7RVRyFGXtxKuC1OAROcUTsqsMWeDvhcL-Jx25Pkn3CJAY6EPDIBE6aTdyNKBrVNUF8-cQXbHQ9-aufFJ38rMet43407gANunvRd-XAJlgoodmNrl47AwKtDL85ODWvb_is8mj8rV6b_neg0t3StKu_CzCCXKG4CBlYwQE-FRhAgXCIu84Vm7WFPoyrpI6VTbqXbgCnimN49k4lJhvtNQVDK-QuO6eobfkxmxxvxAeg/-YVdk85KKY7QK63Uat7Ac7zNpIswmEsc/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="打破瑞典的自由政治后，民粹主义者失去了权力"&gt;战胜民粹主义的威胁&lt;/a&gt;。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ixE4E49Og5Zw/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" alt="" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="替代" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ixE4E49Og5Zw/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;或者说，自由民主国家是否需要&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/LxMxBE1xBZYjtob_jEvFNJRwZyh3kokdQiJKfLT1KhRRn5wy3OmYBTpH3QuOrYHPRgMdqudlzkCZ9QlWHQte9x_EInuLFMUSXioYo74kxiO_fJ6wti20hB1Qlwf8SQmS4oMeYHalGzA6C2CTfpe_j_4cXHaJSkk-PKUn_Vkfe-8Xjf6TG-JyMoHxNvppmIgS1xmUdVHQTqCis8xGZGw34AptLSaUB40Ht7JHU8DoagXU26DjDbglsdnlKGOz0n_IQqkqIZk_dY8nVKNAOkEKgB_EGK1am6qdfx9X4l0AiAtWX57VcHp4GdLVPYzgT_lHHrwHvxh4smyuX948yNyp5yLB2QW3iJdEKO19YA7d-_bK6ZPVqPRPe9I4cPWURseImU-pJygOV_PFfew7ucCYwA13Z_FYNsVEUcb97YD3WVMP4BQw0iw1Xt9EDnt0Gtbltyw1iv-ag1oJeXUUSngLZq77_DnVqkYxVSHzXmQDQ1L6YyA6OgHjW-gngsGatduJ9MYvD8dC9KOhDJsh5f-jr8i1ShBb440D9XhC2xqLVV_o-Q/_mmLPELFoHxp6ABgfUhXjk_dZnejPQy-/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="毒品交易团伙是该郊区瑞典投票的关键"&gt;集体捂住鼻子&lt;/a&gt;，接受具有新纳粹根源的政党如果选民愿意的话就有权执政。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;答案是一个令人不满意的“谁知道呢？”这场竞争势均力敌，而且将通过少数选票来决定。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;奇怪的是，计票工作拖延了数周的秘鲁提供了一条线索。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;在那里，结果&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ssEHDhX7gZHMPrTB66zxl_Nh0PTRzA0qj9dhN8B2ufEDg6t_3jfinImCmNtyU6jUiPoTPspxlqdKKs7EAcebppT1HAoI7X7IakHkESfpONgRGZzHWPrJGpOgB1Id0KNfKGfawOoqgjoxPHhAloZJ8rnM81P724qfdAFygklE-VACmmbqL1_6Ed_hOGUTA2-o8pMKxYsLCWqmtr0qymSDi8QOoRA5RXxIJztztFSV2PinfNHyHp1gRis1mi_jEyxR7oL2bOwszGAzuAtWJuOtUy1PbKyMx26k7sllA0O8YHwrMIPY0W_LyNlnsoVoCSsXxcxvjPjs5S